    "structure_license": "CC-BY-4.0",
    "structure_license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/",
    "structure_notes": "Source synthesis at 3 GPa/1200 C; structure measured after quench, not an in-situ 3 GPa cell. Ca/Al/Si sites fixed by source, full nominal occupancies. Table 4 EPMA gives Si2.99(1)Al1.98(2)Ca3.03(1)O12 with zero Fe; no defect/occupancy refinement inferred. Oxygen coordinate standard deviations are 0.0001 each; a standard deviation 0.0003 A. Source printed V=1660.55(11) A3; a^3=1660.554613333 A3. No identity with the independently adopted EOS V0 is imposed."
